步骤 复杂度 遍历 \(l\) \(O(n)\) 计算 \(m[i][l]\) \(O(1)\) 计算 \(m[i+1][j]\) \(O(1)\) \(r_{i-1} \times r_l \times r_j\) \(O(1)\) <p>总时间复杂度</p> <p>\(O(n^3)\) — 计算所有 \(m[i][j]\)</p> <pre><code>void OptMatrix(const long r[], int N, TwoDimArray M) {
    int i, j, k, L;
    long ThisM;

    for (i = 1; i &lt;= N; i++)
        M[i][i] = 0;

    for (k = 1; k &lt; N; k++) /* k = j - i */
        for (i = 1; i &lt;= N - k; i++) { /* 对每个位置 */
            j = i + k;
            M[i][j] = Infinity;
            for (L = i; L &lt; j; L++) {
                ThisM = M[i][L] + M[L + 1][j] + r[i - 1] * r[L] * r[j];
                if (ThisM &lt; M[i][j]) /* 更新最小值 */
                    M[i][j] = ThisM;
            } /* end for-L */
        } /* end for-Left */
}
</code></pre> <p>更合适的方式</p> <p>找到一个递增的顺序。</p> \[F[N][i] = \min_k(F[k-i][i] + F[N-k-i][k+1] + r_{k-i-1} \times r_i \times r_{N-i})\]
